OL,3,GNEWSAHouse for sale for #17k - but it
OL,4,Adoesn't have a roof
OL,5,
OL,6,FWith property prices soaring in recent
OL,7,Fyears, the idea of buying your own home
OL,8,Ffor #17,000 might seem like a dream
OL,9,Fcome true.
OL,11,FBut there's a catch - it doesn't have a
OL,12,Froof.
OL,14,FThe "ruined shell" of 400-year-old Ty
OL,15,FDu near Llanberis, Gwynedd, lies in the
OL,16,Fwooded foothills of Wales' highest
OL,17,Fmountain, Yr Wyddfa.
OL,19,FIt dates from the 13th Century and has
OL,20,Fbeen home to north Wales' strongest man
OL,21,Fand the poet Dewi Arfon, according to
OL,22,FAuction House.
